  "details": "1. Enable Selfie Expression.\n\n2. In the FX Animator, use VRC Animator Tracking Control to switch Mouth & Jaw from Tracking to Animation.\n\n3. While Mouth & Jaw is set to Animation, the jaw sinks upward significantly, causing the facial expression to break.\n\n4. Switching back to Tracking restores the face to normal.\n\nAdditional Information\n\n* If you switch to Animation while the mouth is wide open during Tracking, the face remains in a normal state.\n\nHypothesis (Unconfirmed)\n\nSelfie Expression appears to use negative values of aa to represent the closed-mouth state.\n\nBecause of this, the mouth state at the moment of switching from Tracking to Animation may affect how the mouth shape is evaluated while Animation is active.",
